Stillpiece artwork collection

The original artworks shown in these images are in the public domain or
were dedicated to the public domain (CC0) by the institutions that hold
them: the Cleveland Museum of Art, U.S. federal agencies and the Library
of Congress. No copyright is claimed in the original works. The source of
each work is listed in catalog.json; to reuse an original work, take it
from its source institution.

The selection and arrangement of this collection and the catalog
(catalog.json), including its titles, translations, difficulty levels and
other data, are Copyright (c) 2026 Alper Bağlı. All rights reserved.

They are published here only so that the Stillpiece app can download
them. You may not copy, redistribute or use the catalog, or this
collection as a whole or in substantial part, in another app, service,
website or dataset without written permission.
